# Maintainer: Kumar-Jy
# Kernel 6.16 with full nabu hardware support:
# - rodriguezst recipe (SM8150 baseline, display, audio, USB, sensors)
# - PM8150B SMB5 charger (0014b, 0051-0057) replacing LN8000
# - nabu-camera overlay (OV13B10 rear + OV8856 front + CN3927 AF, camss/cci)
# - nabu-iris overlay (SM8150 Iris1/Venus decode) + 0058 s2idle suspend fix
# - nabu-accelerometer overlay (LSM6DSO SLPI/SSC, FastRPC/PDR patch, SLPI enabled)
# - Unified boot DTB: sm8150-xiaomi-nabu-iris-camera-accelerometer-slpi-boot-only.dtb
# - Automated UKI generation with rollback preservation (arch-linux-nabu-old.efi)

